## blocks-world-simple: blocks world under the world conventions (world conventions, ^environment none)
## one task-action operator (move-block) applied internally; no look-ahead

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

## Task settings (after the library, which sets its own defaults)
chunk never
multi-attributes object 7
decide indifferent-selection --softmax   # Soar default, restored after agent-world (-e)

source initialize-blocks-world.soar
source elaborations.soar
source move-block.soar
source preferences.soar
